Server init.

>> x := Blob bag-o: 65 matang: ['char'].
# for this test you need set a path to libc (puts)
>> libname := Programa kahikayan: ['FFITESTLIB'].
Server isumpay: (
 Lista bag-o ;
 libname ;
 ['putchar'] ;
 ( Lista bag-o ; ['char'] ) ;
 ['void'] ;
 ['Print'] ;
 ['char:']
).
Print char: (x gikan-sa: 0 gitas-on: 1), bag-ong-linya.
x buhii.

